{"id":"8609481d2b84cdde","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-open-winning-certificate.md","title":"I 的开集胜策恰有可搜索的有限证书","display":"lem-open-winning-certificate — I 的开集胜策恰有可搜索的有限证书","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-open-winning-certificate","aliases":["20-lem-open-winning-certificate"],"display":"lem-open-winning-certificate — I 的开集胜策恰有可搜索的有限证书","chapter":"15","section":"15.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 15.1.2(i) 的完整证书论证","source_printed_pages":[218],"source_pdf_pages":[247],"depends_on":["[[20-df-finite-winning-certificate]]","[[20-thm-konig]]","[[20-df-finite-code]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-open-winning-certificate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-open-winning-certificate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-open-winning-certificate — I 的开集胜策恰有可搜索的有限证书"},{"key":"chapter","html":"15"},{"key":"section","html":"15.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 15.1.2(i) 的完整证书论证"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>218</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>247</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"efc26dd0829b9c99\" href=\"?note=efc26dd0829b9c99\" title=\"20-df-finite-winning-certificate\">20-df-finite-winning-certificate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b4c1ab1358773e54\" href=\"?note=b4c1ab1358773e54\" title=\"20-thm-konig\">20-thm-konig</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho]\">\\(A=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho]\\)</span> 是有效开类；策略量化全部偶数长度历史，使用同一 Gale–Stewart 先手约定。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"efc26dd0829b9c99\" href=\"?note=efc26dd0829b9c99\" title=\"20-df-finite-winning-certificate\">20-df-finite-winning-certificate</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b4c1ab1358773e54\" href=\"?note=b4c1ab1358773e54\" title=\"20-thm-konig\">20-thm-konig</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}open-winning-certificate}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n(\\exists s\\ \\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A))\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists P\\ \\operatorname{WCert}_S(P),\\\\\n(\\exists P\\ \\operatorname{WCert}_S(P))\\Rightarrow\n\\exists s\\le_T\\varnothing\\ \\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}open-winning-certificate}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n(\\exists s\\ \\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A))\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists P\\ \\operatorname{WCert}_S(P),\\\\\n(\\exists P\\ \\operatorname{WCert}_S(P))\\Rightarrow\n\\exists s\\le_T\\varnothing\\ \\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给任意 I 胜策 s，所有遵循 s 且尚未有 S 前缀的历史组成二进制树。若高度无界，König 引理给一条遵循 s 且永远避开 A 的路径，与胜策矛盾；因此有有限高度界 N。取全部遵循 s、长度至多 N 的历史作为有限树，并可在已获胜节点提前停下；叶均有 S 前缀，I 节点唯一选枝，II 节点保留双枝，故得到证书。反向，对证书内非叶 I 节点读取唯一子位，其他全部 I 历史取默认位 0；这是全可计算策略。每条遵循路径在有限步内到达证书的叶，已进入 A。枚举所有有限树代码，检查树和分枝条件，并行等待每叶的 S 前缀；若有胜策，某个有限证书终被发现。这提供承诺输入上的停止搜索，不要求原胜策可计算，也不声称判定任意有效开博弈是否 I 必胜。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 15.1.2(i) 的完整证书论证；印刷页 218；PDF 第 247 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-finite-winning-certificate","status":"resolved","id":"efc26dd0829b9c99","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-winning-certificate]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-konig","status":"resolved","id":"b4c1ab1358773e54","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-konig]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-winning-certificate","status":"resolved","id":"efc26dd0829b9c99","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-winning-certificate]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-konig","status":"resolved","id":"b4c1ab1358773e54","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-winning-certificate]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-winning-certificate]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-winning-certificate]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}open-winning-certificate}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n(\\exists s\\ \\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A))\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists P\\ \\operatorname{WCert}_S(P),\\\\\n(\\exists P\\ \\operatorname{WCert}_S(P))\\Rightarrow\n\\exists s\\le_T\\varnothing\\ \\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":2277,"backlinks":[{"id":"8372f8b6f584a62e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-lem-open-winning-certificate]]；see [[20-df-closed-winning-strategies]]；see [[20-thm-low-basis]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]。"},{"id":"cd307d59aba6545f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-lem-open-winning-certificate]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"}],"outgoing":["efc26dd0829b9c99","b4c1ab1358773e54","59004ac6d23e86f8","e343870c773cb68e"]}